// 露杯 Dewcup（ART-SPEC 4.2）：郁金香杯、闭眼微笑、头顶露珠。以石籽荚为模板（裁决五）。
// 两层绘制（ADR-016 第 2 节）：idle（时钟）只画杯身，produce（生产计时器进度）只画露珠、光晕与哈欠。
Rig(
    kind: Guardian,
    rest: "rest",
    flash: true,
    parts: [
        (name: "shadow", pivot: (64, 120), z: 0),
        (name: "stem", pivot: (64, 119), z: 1),
        (name: "halo", parent: Some("cup"), pivot: (64, 44), z: 2),
        (name: "cup", pivot: (64, 97), z: 3),
        (name: "drop", parent: Some("cup"), pivot: (64, 60), z: 4),
        (name: "blush", parent: Some("cup"), pivot: (66, 82), z: 5),
        (name: "eyes", parent: Some("cup"), pivot: (65, 75), z: 6),
        (name: "mouth", parent: Some("cup"), pivot: (65, 85), z: 7),
        (name: "yawn", parent: Some("cup"), pivot: (66, 85), z: 8, hidden: true),
    ],
)
